    "summary": "Spend 1 CP in either player's [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase) or the opponent's [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), right after an enemy unit picks its targets. Choose a **TYRANIDS** unit of yours that at least one of that enemy unit's attacks targets.\n\nFor the rest of the phase, its models have:\n\n- **[Feel No Pain 6+](vsdata:core-ability/feel-no-pain)** while the unit is outside your army's Synapse Range\n- **[Feel No Pain 5+](vsdata:core-ability/feel-no-pain)** while it is within that range",
